"path": "/@gonzo/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d30c34f7/uploads/origins/4cb9c0a9-844b-41ec-b689-3a37f85a4cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb36702bdb94d375215b5b468506dfd8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d30c34f7/uploads/origins/4cb9c0a9-844b-41ec-b689-3a37f85a4cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb36702bdb94d375215b5b468506dfd8, https://si.imgix.net/d30c34f7/uploads/origins/4cb9c0a9-844b-41ec-b689-3a37f85a4cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=258fa5c720ecdf154493a022761a6643 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d30c34f7/uploads/origins/4cb9c0a9-844b-41ec-b689-3a37f85a4cbd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ad880382b7c30d82da8c8f023476ae11 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、あなたの絵は素敵です！\n私のアバターを描いてくれませんか？\n全部あなたに決めてもらいます！\nありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18sazeu2FARQ7H6kA6gutnomnm1mt5mfr", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@gonzo/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6422e88d/uploads/origins/51d11ad3-0ce5-4328-b916-0f51d51d1246?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=550485a0ea1d846fec69fcb3e0956831", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6422e88d/uploads/origins/51d11ad3-0ce5-4328-b916-0f51d51d1246?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=550485a0ea1d846fec69fcb3e0956831, https://si.imgix.net/6422e88d/uploads/origins/51d11ad3-0ce5-4328-b916-0f51d51d1246?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14249fad95ebd5accdc67fbdb9e83a18 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6422e88d/uploads/origins/51d11ad3-0ce5-4328-b916-0f51d51d1246?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7d5bf44c8901c879009043929387298 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのアピールを受け取りました！私のOC、アリスのイラストをお願いしたい